3:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Breadcrumb","className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-6","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-fg-muted","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/","className":"hover:text-fg","children":"Home"}]}],["$","li",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"/"}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"hover:text-fg","children":"Learning Centre"}]}],["$","li",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"/"}],["$","li",null,{"className":"text-fg","aria-current":"page","children":"Paid Traffic Leak Map"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8 md:p-10","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent","children":"Diagnostic Framework · Paid Traffic"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Discover 9 Paid Traffic Conversion Leaks on Your Landing Page"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Every dollar spent on ads passes through a fixed sequence of stages before it either converts or leaks. This map identifies the stage, the signal that confirms it is broken, and the specific fix - in order of where traffic typically leaks first."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-paid-traffic-leak-map&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L10",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"How to use this map"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Work through the leaks in sequence - each stage gates the next. A visitor who exits at the message-match stage (Leak 1) never reaches the form (Leak 4). Identify the first stage where your analytics show an anomaly and fix that before moving further down the map."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Each leak entry includes: the funnel stage, the analytics signal that confirms it is active, why it causes the loss, and the specific fix."}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-5","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-7","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"rounded-full border border-accent/30 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-accent","children":"Ad → Landing Page"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-fg-muted font-medium","children":["Leak ",1]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-fg","children":"Message-Match Break"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-4 rounded-lg bg-bg p-3","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-muted mb-1","children":"Signal"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg","children":"Healthy CTR on the ad, high bounce rate on the page (above 70%), under 15 seconds time-on-page"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted text-sm","children":"The ad creates a specific expectation - a keyword, an offer, a tone - and the landing page does not fulfil it. The visitor scans the first screen, does not recognise what they clicked on, and leaves before processing any content. This is a high-volume leak in many paid funnels because it affects every ad group pointing to a generic page."}],"$L11","$L12","$L13"]}],"$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18"]}],"$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c"]}]]}]
